      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be manna met|sunge . Anan esne gebyreð to metsunge . xii . pund godes cornes . 7 ii . scipæteras. 7 .i. god me|tecu wuduræden be landside.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the provisioning of men Each labourer is due as provisions, twelve pounds of good corn and two sheep carcasses and one good food cow [and] an arrangement to gather wood.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[8] Be manna metsunge. Anan esne gebyreð to metsunge XII pund godes cornes 7 II scipæteras 7 I god metecu, wuduræden be landside.</ab>
      </div>
